{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212200","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1121220001:0":{"text":"Let go of me... I can walk by myself!","source_cn":"放开我……我能自己走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09470B81645980C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121220002:0":{"text":"If you hadn't tried to escape several times already, I wouldn't have to do this.","source_cn":"姑娘，要不是你一路上好几次想要逃跑，我也不至于这么对你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD59F7F7B3FDC8C13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121220003:0":{"text":"Valen, you've returned. Seems like you've brought someone along...","source_cn":"维伦，你们回来了，看样子有所收获。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF4077DB083CC6D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121220004:1":{"text":"General, you won't believe it... We captured Illucia's daughter.","source_cn":"将军，你一定想不到，我们抓住了黑金女士的女儿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5947800B7B8F5561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121220005:2":{"text":"What?!","source_cn":"什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x651734008AA80CB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121220006:1":{"text":"To be precise, she claims to be Illucia's daughter, but we have doubts about her true origins.","source_cn":"准确来说……她自称是黑金女士的女儿，我认为她的身份还有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B0FAD09644F33DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121220007:1":{"text":"As you can see, she appears to be of Wilder descent.","source_cn":"如各位所见，她的长相更像是绿裔联盟的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD066A52BDDEBB3A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121220008:1":{"text":"Lenya, would you agree?","source_cn":"蕾米雅，你也这么认为吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EA862B91DAD8AC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121220009:0":{"text":"You're...","source_cn":"你是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC719D3F612EC005D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121220010:0":{"text":"Laura?","source_cn":"阿露拉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x672EBB37991A898D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121220011:0":{"text":"What...?","source_cn":"什么……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42DA373FF8985A88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1121220012:2":{"text":"Could it be...? No, that would be impossible.","source_cn":"是阿露拉吗……不对，她不可能出现在这里，是我认错了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73197D1241A29B25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1121220013:0":{"text":"Name... That name just now, who does it belong to?","source_cn":"名字……\\n刚才那个名字，是谁的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCDDC42138DC894D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1121220014:0":{"text":"Why should I tell you?","source_cn":"我为什么要告诉你？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEF22D56607F7E9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1121220015:0":{"text":"Because I've heard that name in my dreams many, many times.","source_cn":"因为那个名字在我的梦中出现过，出现了很多很多次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F0E04B854F65011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1121220016:0":{"text":"I... want to know who owns that name.","source_cn":"我……想知道它属于谁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB11EFB782F65626C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1121220017:0":{"text":"Well, that's too bad. From where I stand, we're enemies.","source_cn":"不告诉你哦。从现在的立场来说，我们可是敌人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62B2728D41DF3603","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1121220018:0":{"text":"This mystery just got deeper.","source_cn":"似乎有些隐情啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x706079407EB5194E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1121220019:0":{"text":"Take this girl and keep her under strict guard.","source_cn":"来人，先把这位姑娘带下去，严加看管。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC214B657CFC8BBBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1121220020:0":{"text":"You, Cat Ears.","source_cn":"那个长着猫耳朵的人——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DE5A2CDC7B0A765","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1121220021:0":{"text":"Hey! My name's Lenya. No silly nicknames, got it?","source_cn":"打住！我叫蕾米雅，不要随便给我取外号。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FE938578FE91385","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1121220022:0":{"text":"If I don't run away, will you tell me about the owner of that name?","source_cn":"如果我不逃走，你会告诉我吗？告诉我那个名字的主人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE400602778B0183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1121220023:0":{"text":"Depends on my mood.","source_cn":"看我的心情咯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA5ECCD3D2A6AB60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1121220024:0":{"text":"Then I'll wait patiently.","source_cn":"我会等你的回答。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98D32C84CE6E6DC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔法十一":{"text":"Aves 11","source":"阿尔法十一","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"Valen","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:霍根":{"text":"Hogan","source":"霍根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"Lyca","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:蕾米雅":{"text":"Lenya","source":"蕾米雅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":5}}